rsion":31,"items":73,"primary":75,"id":95,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[74],{},{"CardImage":76,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":85,"CardText":86,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":80,"copyright":46,"url":81,"id":82,"edit":83},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,670,"A cityscape showing Mexico on a sunny day.","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7WNC57c43Q3f9Hi_Mexico.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z7WNC57c43Q3f9Hi",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"none","Shipping to Mexico",[87,92],{"type":88,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":91},"paragraph","Mexico is home to exotic beaches and the world’s largest pyramid. Whether you’re sending items to Mérida or Cancún, you’ll need a reliable parcel delivery and courier service that best suits your needs.",[],"ltr",{"type":88,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":91},"When you send parcels to Mexico with Evri, you can do so in just 18 to 21 days. We offer full tracking with cover up to £20 included as standard. So, not only can you keep tabs on your parcel, but you can rest assured that it will reach Mexico safe and sound.",[],"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":98,"version":31,"items":99,"primary":115,"id":124,"slice_type":125,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[100,103,106,109,112],{"Col1Content":101,"Col2Content":102},"250g","£12.99",{"Col1Content":104,"Col2Content":105},"500g","£16.29",{"Col1Content":107,"Col2Content":108},"1kg","£22.19",{"Col1Content":110,"Col2Content":111},"2kg","£26.89",{"Col1Content":113,"Col2Content":114},"5kg+","£47.99",{"SectionTitle":116,"SectionSubtitle":117,"Col1Header":118,"Col2Header":119,"InformationTableButtonUrl":120,"InformationTableButtonText":123,"isTableShort":20},"Cost of sending parcels to Mexico from the UK","When you send packages to Mexico, you can be sure you’re getting a great service at a low price with Evri. You can send parcels internationally up to 15kg. See how cheap it is based on some of our more popular parcel weights:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":121,"url":122},"087062bc-ad81-4fc8-a983-9392a48345ce","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Mexico","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":127,"version":31,"items":128,"primary":129,"id":185,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":130,"CardText":131,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":183,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in Mexico",[132,135,142,147,152,157,161,166,170,175,180],{"type":88,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":91},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":136,"text":137,"spans":138,"direction":91},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[139],{"start":66,"end":140,"type":141},14,"strong",{"type":136,"text":143,"spans":144,"direction":91},"Constitution Day  – 02\u002F02\u002F2026",[145],{"start":66,"end":146,"type":141},17,{"type":136,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":91},"Benito Juárez’s Birthday – 16\u002F03\u002F2026",[150],{"start":66,"end":151,"type":141},25,{"type":136,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":91},"Holy Week – 29\u002F03\u002F2026 - 05\u002F04\u002F2026",[155],{"start":66,"end":156,"type":141},9,{"type":136,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":91},"Labour Day – 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[160],{"start":66,"end":156,"type":141},{"type":136,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":91},"Independence Day – 16\u002F09\u002F2026",[164],{"start":66,"end":165,"type":141},16,{"type":136,"text":167,"spans":168,"direction":91},"Day of the Dead – 31\u002F10\u002F2026 - 02\u002F11\u002F2026",[169],{"start":66,"end":165,"type":141},{"type":136,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":91},"Revolution Day – 16\u002F11\u002F2026",[173],{"start":66,"end":174,"type":141},15,{"type":136,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":91},"Christmas – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[178],{"start":66,"end":179,"type":141},11,{"type":88,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":91},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":184},"Any","card$ee1e5db0-65e5-48fd-b421-c7820b325548",{"variation":187,"version":31,"items":188,"primary":250,"id":260,"slice_type":261,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[189,211,230],{"Title":190,"Description":195,"Image":199,"Label":46,"UrlText":193,"Url":207,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":210,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[191],{"type":192,"text":193,"spans":194},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[196],{"type":88,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":91},"Book your delivery online and choose from 9,000+ ParcelShops to drop off your parcel. Use our Print in ParcelShop device to print your label in-store for free. You can also visit selected Post Offices to book in person with us.",[],{"dimensions":200,"alt":202,"copyright":46,"url":203,"id":204,"edit":205},{"width":78,"height":201},667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":206,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},470,{"link_type":36,"key":208,"url":209},"7184f5ce-873a-41ac-9e29-9645163b3502","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":184},{"Title":212,"Description":216,"Image":220,"Label":46,"UrlText":214,"Url":226,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":229,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[213],{"type":192,"text":214,"spans":215},"Lockers",[],[217],{"type":88,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":91},"Book online, print out your label and head to your nearest Locker. Scan the barcode, place your parcel in an available Locker, and we’ll do the rest. ",[],{"dimensions":221,"alt":222,"copyright":46,"url":223,"id":224,"edit":225},{"width":78,"height":201},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":156,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":227,"url":228},"1e3132b6-cfda-43f3-8000-1ad89e572eaf","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":184},{"Title":231,"Description":235,"Image":239,"Label":46,"UrlText":245,"Url":246,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":249,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[232],{"type":192,"text":233,"spans":234},"Courier collection",[],[236],{"type":88,"text":237,"spans":238,"direction":91},"Let us do the heavy lifting. Arrange for a courier to collect your parcel from your home or office for door-to-door service. We'll even give you a 1-hour window for when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":240,"alt":241,"copyright":46,"url":242,"id":243,"edit":244},{"width":78,"height":201},"An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats.","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDp5bqstJ9-cfh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4424.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDp5bqstJ9-cfh",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":247,"url":248},"69eb1150-75bd-4f3b-9448-f8302f021d5f","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":184},{"SectionTitle":251,"SectionDescription":256,"theme":46},[252],{"type":253,"text":254,"spans":255},"heading2","How to send to parcels to Mexico",[],[257],{"type":88,"text":258,"spans":259},"When you send packages to Mexico with Evri, the choice is all yours. There are three ways to send your parcels to Mexico.",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":263,"version":31,"items":264,"primary":266,"id":294,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[265],{},{"CardImage":267,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":274,"CardText":275,"ButtonText":291,"ButtonUrl":292,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":268,"alt":269,"copyright":46,"url":270,"id":271,"edit":272},{"width":78,"height":201},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc",{"x":273,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},47,"Sending multiple parcels to Mexico",[276,279,282,285,288],{"type":88,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":91},"Sending multiple marketplace items has never been easier. With our bulk integrations tool, you can manage all your shipping needs with just a few clicks.",[],{"type":136,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":91},"Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":136,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":91},"Package up your items and book your parcels in one go",[],{"type":136,"text":286,"spans":287,"direction":91},"Print off your postage label at home or in-store",[],{"type":136,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":91},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or arrange a courier collection.",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":293,"url":38},"b1e99d87-0665-4f1e-b812-6f08a600f7c2","card$237978c2-07c6-47f5-baba-2223b0b34181",{"variation":296,"version":31,"items":297,"primary":379,"id":382,"slice_type":383,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[298,319,331,343,355,367],{"title":299,"content":300,"icon":312},"Regular tracking updates",[301],{"type":88,"text":302,"spans":303,"direction":91},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[304,311],{"start":305,"end":306,"type":307,"data":308},55,63,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":309,"target":310},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":305,"end":306,"type":141},{"dimensions":313,"alt":315,"copyright":46,"url":316,"id":317,"edit":318},{"width":314,"height":314},40,"Phone icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":320,"content":321,"icon":325},"Parcel cover",[322],{"type":88,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":326,"alt":327,"copyright":46,"url":328,"id":329,"edit":330},{"width":314,"height":314},"Money icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":332,"content":333,"icon":337},"Customs made easier",[334],{"type":88,"text":335,"spans":336,"direction":91},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":338,"alt":339,"copyright":46,"url":340,"id":341,"edit":342},{"width":314,"height":314},"Passport icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":344,"content":345,"icon":349},"Flexible printing options",[346],{"type":88,"text":347,"spans":348,"direction":91},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":350,"alt":351,"copyright":46,"url":352,"id":353,"edit":354},{"width":314,"height":314},"Printer icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":356,"content":357,"icon":361},"Bulk send",[358],{"type":88,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":91},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":362,"alt":363,"copyright":46,"url":364,"id":365,"edit":366},{"width":314,"height":314},"Laptop icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":368,"content":369,"icon":373},"Trusted by top UK brands",[370],{"type":88,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":374,"alt":375,"copyright":46,"url":376,"id":377,"edit":378},{"width":314,"height":314},"Success icon","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":380,"title":381,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to Mexico with Evri?","list_block$8e5063b3-cbd9-4ca4-978e-dae61facdef2","list_block",{"variation":127,"version":31,"items":385,"primary":387,"id":414,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":46},[386],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":388,"CardText":389,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":413,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to the Mexico",[390,398],{"type":88,"text":391,"spans":392,"direction":91},"While you can send lots of items to Mexico with Evri, there are a few restrictions – such as pharmaceutical products and electronic cigarettes. For a full breakdown of what you can and can’t send, check out our prohibited items list.",[393,397],{"start":394,"end":395,"type":307,"data":396},211,232,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":310},{"start":394,"end":395,"type":141},{"type":88,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":91},"The IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides will also keep you up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels to Mexico via airlines.",[401,406,407,412],{"start":402,"end":403,"type":307,"data":404},4,36,{"link_type":36,"url":405,"target":310},"mexico.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":402,"end":403,"type":141},{"start":408,"end":409,"type":307,"data":410},45,72,{"link_type":36,"url":411,"target":310},"mexico.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":408,"end":409,"type":141},{"link_type":184},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":263,"version":31,"items":416,"primary":418,"id":434,"slice_type":435,"slice_label":46},[417],{},{"title":419,"bodyText":420,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":424,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":424,"buttonText":123,"buttonLink":425,"image":427},"Customs",[421],{"type":88,"text":422,"spans":423,"direction":91},"When you send a parcel internationally with us, we do all the hard work for you. There's no need to worry about filling in a customs form, all you need to do is fill in the contents information online, and we will take care of the rest.",[],true,{"link_type":36,"key":426,"url":122},"175d7236-2d1c-4647-87f7-d0549ee1fcb0",{"dimensions":428,"alt":429,"copyright":46,"url":430,"id":431,"edit":432},{"width":78,"height":201},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","mexico.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":66,"y":433,"zoom":67,"background":68},2,"feature_banner$3124354b-a3a0-4017-9050-a9d7777ddb76","feature_banner",{"variation":127,"version":31,"items":437,"primary":439,"id":475,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":46},[438],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":440,"CardText":441,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":474,"IsEco":20},"Address format for shipping to Mexico from the UK",[442,445,448,452,456,461,466,471],{"type":88,"text":443,"spans":444},"Like every country, Mexico has its own standard address format. When writing out a Mexican address for your parcels, remember that the recipient’s name comes first, followed by the street name, municipality, postcode, city, state and country.",[],{"type":88,"text":446,"spans":447},"For example:",[],{"type":88,"text":449,"spans":450},"Mr J Bloggs",[451],{"start":66,"end":179,"type":141},{"type":88,"text":453,"spans":454},"Privada Union 15",[455],{"start":66,"end":165,"type":141},{"type":88,"text":457,"spans":458},"Col. Agricola Pantitlan, Iztacalco",[459],{"start":66,"end":460,"type":141},34,{"type":88,"text":462,"spans":463},"08100 Ciudad de Mexico, CDMEX",[464],{"start":66,"end":465,"type":141},29,{"type":88,"text":467,"spans":468},"MEXICO",[469],{"start":66,"end":470,"type":141},6,{"type":88,"text":472,"spans":473},"But don’t worry, we’ll make sure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label with us.",[],{"link_type":184},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":263,"version":31,"items":477,"primary":511,"id":513,"slice_type":514,"slice_label":46},[478,499],{"questionTitle":479,"questionBody":480},"Is there import tax from the UK to Mexico?",[481,484,487,490],{"type":88,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":91},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":91},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":488,"spans":489,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":88,"text":491,"spans":492,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[493,498],{"start":494,"end":495,"type":307,"data":496},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":497,"target":310},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":494,"end":495,"type":141},{"questionTitle":500,"questionBody":501},"Can I track my international parcels?",[502],{"type":88,"text":503,"spans":504,"direction":91},"Yes. When shipping to Mexico with Evri, full tracking is included in your postage fee. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on our international tracking page. Afterwards, you can track your international Evri parcel at every stage of its journey.",[505,510],{"start":506,"end":507,"type":307,"data":508},143,170,{"link_type":36,"url":509,"target":310},"mexico.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":506,"end":507,"type":141},{"title":512},"FAQs about sending parcels to Mexico","frequently_asked_questions$4b347c1d-5b13-4dde-a539-32cb5a992858","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,97,126,186,262,295,384,415,436,476],["Reactive",517],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":518,"$sclients":584,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":587},{"abtasty":519,"accessibe":522,"appPromoBanner":525,"autoDivertUpdates":528,"awin":531,"bulkInternational":534,"bulkSendEnabled":537,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":540,"enableBasketCount":543,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":546,"euCustomsDuty":549,"groovyAdvert":552,"newInternationalSendFlow":555,"newinternationalpages":562,"oohPreferenceFlag":566,"opentel":569,"premium":572,"savedCards":575,"smallParcelSize":578,"yourPricesDrawer":581},{"_createdAt":520,"_updatedAt":521,"enabled":424},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":52